  "notes": [
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-add-packageurl-0000001158245065#section39581727",
      "text": "如果您将软件包保存在自己的服务器上，可以直接调用本接口将软件包提交到AppGallery Connect服务器。华为服务器会自动从下载地址中下载软件包后提交，不会关联版本。本操作只提交软件包，不发布软件包。接口调用者的角色：账号持有者、管理员、APP管理员。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-add-packageurl-0000001158245065#section39581727",
      "text": "该接口需要在华为侧下载软件包并处理后上传，耗时较长，为异步接口。接口会立即响应成功，但这并不意味着最终发布成功。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-add-packageurl-0000001158245065#section39581727",
      "text": "您可以遵循回调结果通知接口的约束， 开发并提供回调能力，通过本接口的callbackAddr参数传入回调地址，用于接收软件包处理结果。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-add-packageurl-0000001158245065#section39581727",
      "text": "您也可以自行调用查询应用信息接口判断应用是否已经提交审核成功（releaseState为4），或者登录AppGallery Connect官网查看提审状态。"
    },
    {
      "section": "接口约束",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-add-packageurl-0000001158245065#section133mcpsimp",
      "text": "非中国大陆开发者如需使用该API，应用发布地区必须包含中国大陆。中国大陆开发者无限制。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-add-packageurl-0000001158245065#section236517415165",
      "text": "API客户端方式和OAuth客户端方式的区别请参见使用入门。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-add-packageurl-0000001158245065#section236517415165",
      "text": "API客户端方式："
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-add-packageurl-0000001158245065#section236517415165",
      "text": "OAuth客户端方式："
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-add-packageurl-0000001158245065#section15344132481910",
      "text": "请求Body中使用JSON格式携带详细的发布信息，参数如下表所示。"
    },
    {
      "section": "Postman调试",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-add-packageurl-0000001158245065#section311913164588",
      "text": "您可以使用Postman在线调试此接口。"
    }
  ],
